### 1. 创建产品
POST http://localhost:8082/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Apple iPhone 15 Pro",
  "description": "苹果 iPhone 15 Pro 智能手机，搭载 A17 Pro 芯片",
  "price": 9999,
  "stock": 100,
  "category": "手机",
  "brand": "Apple",
  "tags": ["智能手机", "5G", "iOS"],
  "isActive": true
}


